        <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #0A3D3A; margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0; font-weight: 700;">IRMAA Calculator (Multi-Year) &rarr;</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #4B5A6E; margin: 0;">See your full Part B and Part D IRMAA surcharges side-by-side by income tier.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/medicare-late-enrollment-penalty-calculator/" style="display: block; background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 0.5rem; padding: 1.25rem; text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #0A3D3A; margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0; font-weight: 700;">Part B Penalty Calculator &rarr;</h3>
